00:07:17.208 --> 00:07:22.103
<v Host>It was her second time. Her first baby was born in twenty twenty-two.

00:07:22.704 --> 00:07:34.103
<v Host>That's all for today. A tiny new dolphin is now swimming beside her mother in Okinawa. If you visit, you might even see her drinking milk by the window. See you tomorrow!

